# 'Nothing gated' (docs/squeeze.md): the crew van from the park to castro_18th by street (1392 m), the driving autopilot on the
# sim's own traffic network (tools/squeeze/routes.ts writes this file). The van must arrive within 25 m of the route's end.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
